Third-party data in this repository is NOT covered by the MIT License above.

sources/hsm-column-db/database.csv
    PQRI / hydrophobic-subtraction model column database, retrieved from
    https://hplccolumns.org/database/database.csv. Licensed under Creative
    Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 United States
    (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 US), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/us/.
    Commercial use of that file needs separate permission from its maintainers.
    See sources/hsm-column-db/README.md.

prototype/soluteml-bias/overlap.csv
    Contains descriptor values from SoluteDB (Chung et al. 2022, Zenodo record
    5792296), licensed CC BY 4.0.

experiments/solutedb-census/census.csv
    Lists RepoRT compounds (InChIKey, SMILES) with a tier computed against
    SoluteDB. RepoRT is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0
    (https://github.com/michaelwitting/RepoRT), so this file is shared under
    CC BY-SA 4.0. See data/report/README.md.

The USP Column Equivalency data and the WSU-2019 (Poole 2019, Elsevier) tables
used during development are not included. See sources/usp-column-db/README.md
and sources/wsu-lser/README.md for how to obtain them.
